  "body": "```\r\nGET https://matrix.org/_matrix/client/r0/rooms/!sdasd:sadasd/joined_members\r\n{\"joined\": {}}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis seems like the wrong thing to be doing. I'm assuming the endpoint takes a shortcut and assumes that if it can't find any members for a room, the list is empty. This should definitely 404.",
